---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";

const description = "Platform-to-platform migration lets DiscussionBridge users change publishing platforms while keeping their existing Discourse conversations and connections to the published content.";
const discussionUrl = "https://forum.codeworkslabs.dev/t/discussionbridge-platform-migrator-by-cwl-plans-updates-and-your-platform-moves/20";
---

<Base title="DiscussionBridge Platform Migrator by CWL — CodeWorksLabs" {description}>
  <section class="product-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> DiscussionBridge Platform Migrator by CWL</p>
      <h1>Change platforms.<br /><em>Keep the discussion.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">{description}</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href={discussionUrl}>Discuss Platform Migrator and share your planned move <span>↗</span></a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/products/discussionbridge/">About DiscussionBridge</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="release-panel">
      <p>Product status</p><strong>In process - Seeking Inputs</strong><span>Optional plugin for DiscussionBridge users</span>
      <dl><div><dt>Requires</dt><dd>DiscussionBridge</dd></div><div><dt>Within DB</dt><dd>DiscussionBridge Platform Migrator</dd></div><div><dt>Maker</dt><dd>CodeWorksLabs</dd></div></dl>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section class="section install-band">
    <div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Separate optional plugin</p><h2>One tab for DB.<br /><em>One for the move.</em></h2></div>
    <div>
      <p>Platform Migrator is planned as a separate optional plugin that communicates with DiscussionBridge. It will appear in DB admin, with the operator using one tab for DiscussionBridge and another for the migration workflow.</p>
      <p>This separation allows the migration tools to develop at their own pace and be used when needed.</p>
      <p>The migration workflow, intake and continuing adapter roles, destination content conversion and importing, and the verified handoff of existing discussion relationships to the new platform are being defined.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section install-band">
    <div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Help shape it</p><h2>Your next platform.<br /><em>Your existing discussions.</em></h2></div>
    <div>
      <p>Tell us which publishing platform you use with DiscussionBridge, which platform you would move to, the direction of publishing and the content or URL details that make the move difficult.</p>
      <p>The existing discussions and applicable publishing direction are the continuity requirement.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={discussionUrl}>Share your planned move and follow updates →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="limitations"><strong>In process - Seeking Inputs</strong><p>Platform-pair and version coverage, compatibility and delivery arrangements remain open. Platform migration is the purpose of this plugin; current DiscussionBridge URL management alone does not deliver it.</p></section>
</Base>
